---
title: SST Initial Cleanup
---
flowchart
  Dup[[Duplicate $INPUT_DIR File Descriptor]] --> OpenDir[[Open $INPUT_DIR Stream]]
  OpenDir--> |Failure: RETURN FALSE| EXIT([RETURN])
  OpenDir --> |Failure| OpenDir?{Max Attempts Exhausted?}
  OpenDir? --> |Yes: RETURN FALSE| EXIT
  OpenDir? --> |No| OpenDir
  OpenDir --> |Success| Orchestrator((Orchestrator))

  Orchestrator --> |Check for Skip| Orchestrator?{Skipped?}
  Orchestrator? --> |Yes: RETURN FALSE| EXIT
  Orchestrator? --> |No| CloseDir[[Close $INPUT_DIR Stream]]
  CloseDir --> |Failure: RETURN FALSE| EXIT
  CloseDir --> |Success| ClosedDir[/$INPUT_DIR Stream Closed/]
  ClosedDir --> |RETURN TRUE| EXIT([RETURN])